Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

1. tests/data/a2-example.nam
   The example A2 model that is distributed with NAM Core
   (https://github.com/sdatkinson/NeuralAmpModelerCore, folder example_models).
   NAM Core is released under the MIT licence:
   Copyright (c) 2023 Steven Atkinson.

2. third_party/nlohmann/json.hpp
   nlohmann/json 3.12.0 (https://github.com/nlohmann/json), MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2013-2025 Niels Lohmann.
   Used to read model files. The licence text is in third_party/nlohmann/LICENSE.MIT.

3. NAM Core (git submodule external/NeuralAmpModelerCore)
   Not part of the library and not needed to build or test it. It is used only when the option
   NAMTURBO_BASELINE is on: for the speed and accuracy comparison against NAM Core, and to regenerate the
   reference outputs of the tests. MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2023 Steven Atkinson. It includes the libraries
   Eigen (MPL 2.0) and nlohmann/json (MIT) under their own licences.

tests/data/test-amp-and-cab.nam is a model made by the author of this repository and is released under the same
MIT licence as the rest of the repository.

The file format and the A2 network architecture that this library implements are defined by Neural Amp Modeler
(https://github.com/sdatkinson/neural-amp-modeler) and NAM Core, by Steven Atkinson and contributors.
